<h2 id='what-is-moosend'>📬 What Is Moosend?</h2>

Moosend is a cloud-based email marketing and automation platform founded in 2011. It competes primarily on price-to-feature ratio, targeting SMBs and growing e-commerce brands that need marketing automation sophistication without enterprise-tier contracts. The platform includes a drag-and-drop email builder, a visual automation workflow editor, landing pages, subscription forms, and a real-time analytics dashboard.

For luxury retail specifically, Moosend's appeal sits at the intersection of three things: behavioral segmentation that responds to purchase signals, a clean visual editor that can be pushed toward elevated brand aesthetics, and a pricing model that doesn't require a CFO sign-off to test. It integrates with Shopify, WooCommerce, Magento, and a growing list of CRMs — though its native connections to luxury-specific platforms like NuOrder, Lightspeed, or Gorgias are still maturing.

The platform has been under Sitecore's ownership since 2021, which has accelerated product development and infrastructure investment — a meaningful signal for brands evaluating long-term stability.

